WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.611
Repeated questions and unanswered
messages take up your time,

00:00:03.651 --> 00:00:05.370
and can leave customers waiting.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.842
Between the phone, the
chat and the calendar,

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:10.644
coordinating appointments
becomes a job of its own.

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:13.852
ORQENTIVA brings your
services, your hours,

00:00:13.892 --> 00:00:16.593
your team and your bookings
together in one place.

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:19.444
And it puts an assistant to
work for your customers.

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:24.517
Your customer opens your link and
writes the way they would talk to you:

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.744
“I want a classic haircut
with Ana on Saturday at ten”.

00:00:27.784 --> 00:00:29.738
The assistant checks availability,

00:00:29.778 --> 00:00:33.844
proposes the appointment and only
saves it when the customer confirms.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.029
Questions about cancellations or policies?

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:39.976
The assistant answers from
the documents you publish,

00:00:40.016 --> 00:00:42.144
and shows where each answer comes from.

00:00:43.034 --> 00:00:43.955
And coming soon,

00:00:43.995 --> 00:00:47.678
the same assistant will also
serve your customers on WhatsApp.

00:00:48.568 --> 00:00:52.009
From your dashboard you set
services, prices and durations,

00:00:52.049 --> 00:00:54.074
opening hours and who handles what.

00:00:54.114 --> 00:00:58.145
Every booking shows up in your
calendar, with the customer's contact.

00:00:59.035 --> 00:01:02.201
So your team spends less
time on repeated messages,

00:01:02.241 --> 00:01:08.612
the calendar avoids double bookings and your business
information stays separate from everyone else's.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:13.098
Every business is different, so
we start by understanding yours.

00:01:13.138 --> 00:01:17.246
Tell us what you need in the contact
form and we will prepare a proposal.
